@host = http://localhost:5298

### Salud
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Sincronizar (snapshot de precios + diff de plantilla). Llamar al refrescar.
POST {{host}}/api/sync

### Pestaña 1 — Ligas
GET {{host}}/api/leagues

### Cambiar liga por defecto
PUT {{host}}/api/leagues/1/default

### Pestaña 2 — Jugadores (plantilla activa)
GET {{host}}/api/players

### Editar precio de compra (fallback manual)
PUT {{host}}/api/players/holdings/1/purchase-price
Content-Type: application/json

{ "purchasePrice": 5000000 }

### Pestaña 3 — Historial: sin vender
GET {{host}}/api/history/holdings

### Pestaña 3 — Historial: vendidos (congelados)
GET {{host}}/api/history/sales

### Ajustar precio de venta (recalcula solo G/P)
PUT {{host}}/api/history/sales/1/sale-price
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salePrice": 6000000 }

### Pestaña 4 — Stats
GET {{host}}/api/stats
